description.narrative:
The aim is the protection of of human rights of the internally displaced people in Cabo Delgado province, Mozambique, through the provision of rights to education, legal assistance and psychological support to traumatized and victimized women, men and children and the distribution of humanitarian aid to the most vulnerable
The specific objectives of the initiative are as follows:
•	Increase awareness of human rights and legal advice of internally displaced people;
•	Provide access to professional counselling to traumatized people and victims of violence;
•	Improve the satisfaction of basic needs of hygiene and education material of the most vulnerable;
•	Train religious, youth, civic leaders and local authorities with a view to promote and build social cohesion, a culture of tolerance, peace and contribute to reduced levels of radicalisation.
